KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_TITLE = How inventory stock works
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_VALUE_DATE = Value date and time: this inventory is anchored at %s. New inventories use the configured inventory time (%s). An inventory created at or after the %s entry cutoff must use the next calendar date. Saving or executing later does not replace the anchor with the current time, and Edit retains the existing anchor.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_VIRTUAL_STOCK = Virtual stock: the displayed value represents stock at the billing-day close (%s) on the value date. An open inventory is reconstructed from live stock minus later operational movements; a recorded inventory uses its immutable finalized anchor. Inventory corrections and reversals are excluded from operational movement totals.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_SAVE = Save: stores the physical counts without creating stock movements. A blank line remains uncounted and its stock is not changed.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_EXECUTE = Execute stock movements: reconstructs theoretical stock at the inventory anchor and posts only the difference between the physical count and theoretical stock at that same timestamp, then closes the inventory.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_EDIT_DELETE = Edit and Delete: only the latest recorded inventory of a category and warehouse in the current counting window can change. Edit keeps the current stock effects active while revised counts are staged; Execute replaces them atomically. Deleting that recorded inventory first creates the opposite movements, then removes the inventory record.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_AUTOCLOSE = Automatic closure: every inventory still open at the configured %s automatic closure time is executed by the cron job, including incomplete inventories. Blank products remain unchanged. The next counting window begins at the configured %s entry cutoff.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_READ_ONLY_WINDOW = Read-only interval: from the configured automatic closure time (%s) until the configured entry cutoff (%s), inventories may only be consulted. Creating, saving, executing, editing, and deleting are blocked; only the scheduled automatic closure may write.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_EXPIRED_COUNTS = Expired counts: after the configured %s entry cutoff, an inventory belonging to an earlier counting window cannot be saved, edited, or executed because later stock movements may exist. Delete the stale draft, create the current inventory, and count every product again.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_OPEN_SCOPE = Open inventory: a category and warehouse can have only one initiated inventory. A later duplicate cannot be created, saved, edited, or executed until the first inventory is closed or deleted.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_LOGIC_HISTORY_LOCKED = Recorded history: after the configured %s entry cutoff moves the category and warehouse into a later counting window, recorded inventories from earlier windows are permanently read-only. Edit and Delete are not available.
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_POST_CUTOFF_CONFIRM = This inventory was created at or after the %s entry cutoff. Value date {selected} is not allowed; it must be {required}. Do you want to save it with value date {required}?
KREAPRODUCTS_INVENTORY_POST_CUTOFF_DATE_REQUIRED = This inventory was created at or after the %s entry cutoff. Its value date must be %s.
KREAPRODUCTS_ERROR_INVENTORY_READ_ONLY_WINDOW = Inventories are read-only from %s until %s. During this interval you may only consult them; creating, saving, executing, editing, and deleting are blocked.
KREAPRODUCTS_ERROR_INVENTORY_COUNTS_EXPIRED = This count is no longer valid because stock movements may have occurred after its counting window. Delete this inventory, create a new inventory for %s at %s, and count the products again.
KREAPRODUCTS_ERROR_INVENTORY_TIME_ORDER = The automatic inventory closure time must be earlier than the inventory entry cutoff.
KREAPRODUCTS_ERROR_INVENTORY_SCOPE_OPEN = Inventory %s is still open for this category and warehouse. Close or delete it before starting, saving, editing, or executing another inventory in the same scope.
KREAPRODUCTS_ERROR_INVENTORY_SCOPE_OPEN_UNKNOWN = An older inventory is still open for this category and warehouse. Close or delete the older inventory before saving or executing this one; until then, this duplicate can only be deleted.
KREAPRODUCTS_ERROR_INVENTORY_HISTORY_LOCKED = This recorded inventory belongs to a closed counting window and is permanently read-only.
KREAPRODUCTS_ERROR_INVENTORY_HISTORY_LOCKED_AT_CUTOFF = This recorded inventory belongs to an earlier counting window. After the configured %s entry cutoff it is permanently read-only and cannot be edited or deleted.
QtyInStockWhenInventoryWasCreated = Quantity in stock when the inventory was created (before stock correction)
